Interchange StudentGrade
    documentation 'This interchange defines grades for a grading period or group of grading 
                  'periods. Grades are defined for groups of grading periods in the case where the 
                  'grade is cumulative over a semester or academic year (also referred to as "final 
                  'grades").
    element ReportCard
    element Grade
    element CompetencyObjective
    element LearningObjective
    element StudentCompetencyObjective
    element StudentLearningObjective